  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"0\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"0\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"left right operation\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #f4f4f4;\n  --ink: #1a1c2c;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --error: #b13e53;\n  --border: 4px solid var(--ink);\n  --shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink);\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: min(100%, 400px);\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: var(--border);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  padding: 24px;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.field {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n}\n\ninput,\nselect,\nbutton {\n  font: inherit;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  background: #fff;\n  border: var(--border);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n}\n\ninput:focus-visible,\nselect:focus-visible,\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ffd98a;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);\n}\n\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: var(--ink);\n  color: var(--accent);\n  border: var(--border);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n#result.error {\n  color: var(--error);\n  background: #fff;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const left = document.getElementById('left');\nconst right = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operation = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculate = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction compute() {\n  const a = parseFloat(left.value);\n  const b = parseFloat(right.value);\n\n  if (left.value.trim() === '' || right.value.trim() === '' || !isFinite(a) || !isFinite(b)) {\n    showError();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let value;\n  switch (operation.value) {\n    case 'add':\n      value = a + b;\n      break;\n    case 'subtract':\n      value = a - b;\n      break;\n    case 'multiply':\n      value = a * b;\n      break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (b === 0) {\n        showError();\n        return;\n      }\n      value = a / b;\n      break;\n    default:\n      showError();\n      return;\n  }\n\n  if (!isFinite(value)) {\n    showError();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  result.textContent = String(value);\n  result.classList.remove('error');\n}\n\nfunction showError() {\n  result.textContent = 'Error';\n  result.classList.add('error');\n}\n\ncalculate.addEventListener('click', compute);\n\n[left, right, operation].forEach((el) => {\n  el.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {\n    if (event.key === 'Enter') {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      compute();\n    }\n  });\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA tiny offline pixel-style calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, no network, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in **Left number** and **Right number** (negative values are supported).\n3. Choose an operation from the **Operation** dropdown: add, subtract, multiply, or divide.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in any input/select) to see the result.\n\n## Behavior\n\n- The result is shown as a plain number with no label.\n- Empty inputs, non-finite numbers (e.g. `Infinity`, `NaN`), and division by zero show exactly `Error`.\n- The initial result is `0`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and required element IDs (`left`, `right`, `operation`, `calculate`, `result`).\n- `style.css` — pixel-inspired theme, responsive card layout, focus/hover/pressed states.\n- `script.js` — validation and calculation logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll controls have visible labels, are keyboard-focusable, and show a clear focus outline. The layout works down to 360px wide.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
